        "zone": "ncs",
        "boardRef": "6a2629f436bfe25a75cb4c82",
        "content": "<div data-contents-type=\"text\"><div class=\"fr-image\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-contents-json=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0f6de2218-4c816c7c-4be4-4fe0-881b-d28941a65d50&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:null}\" data-contents-type=\"image\"><div class=\"fe-image-inner\"><img src=\"https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0f6de2218-4c816c7c-4be4-4fe0-881b-d28941a65d50\" alt=\"announcements_EN.jpg\" class=\"fe-image\"></div></div></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Daevas!<br><br>Some players reported that their Early Access status was not properly recognized when logging into the game; we just released a fix for this.<br><br>There were also reports of issues with in-game purchases; this should now be fixed as well.<br>There is no downtime and your client will update to apply the fix the next time you restart it.<br><br>Note: our teams are also aware that some players are running into account linking issues. We're actively looking into this, along with the other issues you've been reporting, and will share an update as soon as we can.<br><br>Thank you for your patience and for your continued support!</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><div class=\"fr-image\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-contents-json=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0f6de5c37-91199638-3052-4c02-9e55-b2cbb481169b&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:null}\" data-contents-type=\"image\"><div class=\"fe-image-inner\"><img src=\"https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0f6de5c37-91199638-3052-4c02-9e55-b2cbb481169b\" alt=\"Bottom_banner.jpg\" class=\"fe-image\"></div></div></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBrea